Third-party material shipped in the repository
----------------------------------------------

Typefaces, each under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1. The licence text
and copyright line travel with each font, in the theme's source/ folder:

  - Share Tech Mono, Carrois Type Design (Fallout theme)
  - Barlow, The Barlow Project Authors (Portal theme)
  - Kanit Bold, The Kanit Project Authors (Vault-Tec theme)

The firmware also compiles in LVGL's Montserrat and the Inter faces in
src/theme/fonts/, both distributed under the same licence.

Artwork: the Vault-Tec theme's plates were cropped and cleaned from a
reference sprite sheet kept at src/theme_assets/vaultec/source/
sheet_reference.png. The repository does not record where that sheet came
from.

Libraries, each under its own licence (see platformio.ini for versions):
GFX Library for Arduino (moononournation), LVGL, ArduinoJson (bblanchon),
WiFiManager (tzapu), XPowersLib (lewisxhe), TJpg_Decoder (Bodmer),
TinyGPSPlus (mikalhart), and PNGdec (bitbank2).

Data services and their credits are listed in README.md.

On the rename
-------------

The rename does not change any of the above. MIT permits modifying and
renaming, and says nothing about what a derived work may be called; what it
requires is that the copyright notice travels with the software, which it
does. The lineage is recorded here precisely BECAUSE the name no longer
carries it.
